(I suppose you're talking about a game on a public server like NAO?)

The non-turn-consuming way to reply is to use the # (extended command);
type the '#' character and an additional ' ' (blank) and then type ahead.
Leave the line on the screen for some time to make it possible for the
observer to read it, then hit the 'Esc' key and continue your game.

